{
  "borough": "Harrow",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The design of the proposed redevelopment would appear as overbearing and\r\nout of keeping, given the prominence of the site within the road, which would\r\nin turn make it very hard to screen off this development from the street scene,\r\nand the fact that all the proposed roofs are flat in a road where pitched roofs\r\nof various shapes and sizes are the prevailing design feature, to the detriment\r\nof the residential and visual amenity of those within the locality, contrary to\r\npolicies CS1 Harrow Core Strategy (2012), D3 London Pan (2021), DM1 Harrow\r\nDevelopment Management Policy (2012) and GR1 Draft New Local Plan (2021-2041).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
